Q: PHP Intelephense doesn&#39;t detect symfony repository functions A: <p>You can insert a type assert:</p>
<pre><code>assert($orderRepo instanceof SubscriptionOrderRepository);
$order = $orderRepo-&gt;findExistingCartOrder(....);
</code></pre>
<p>Or surround the relevant code in a type check block to avoid any error being thrown.</p>
<pre><code>if($orderRepo instanceof SubscriptionOrderRepository)
{
    $order = $orderRepo-&gt;findExistingCartOrder(....);
}
</code></pre>
